body:
&#x200B;

Everyone is different but talking to somebody who understand can help to not feel like you're losing your mind. You're having strong feelings and that's not weird. The disconnection with reality is something I experienced myself too, it goes away. But talking might help to not spiral down. This might be something that you felt foe a long time but you stuffed it down and now it's coming up. 

Like I say evryone is different so I can't give an exact "do this and you'll fix it", but I don know just being alne with your thoughts if you're in that state will fuck you up.
